    ('eps-b2-r-practical-43', 'eps-topik-2026-01', 'EPS_TOPIK', ARRAY['EPS_TOPIK'], 'reading', 'eps-r-practical', 'Signs, Notices and Charts', '안내문: 작업 순서', '공구를 정리한 다음에 하는 일은 무엇입니까?', NULL, NULL, '/api/v1/questions/assets/eps_b2_sign_43', 75, '[{"id": "A", "text": "전원을 끕니다."}, {"id": "B", "text": "기계를 청소합니다."}, {"id": "C", "text": "퇴근 기록을 합니다."}, {"id": "D", "text": "기계를 켭니다."}]'::jsonb, '["C"]'::jsonb, '③ 공구 정리하기 is followed by ④ 퇴근 기록하기, clocking out.', 'medium', ARRAY['EPS_TOPIK Reading', 'Signs, Notices and Charts', 'industrial-safety']::text[], 1, TRUE, 'Text: End-of-shift order. 1. Turn off the power. 2. Clean the machine. 3. Put tools away. 4. Clock out. Question: What comes after putting the tools away? Choices: A. Turn off the power. B. Clean the machine. C. Clock out. D. Turn the machine on.'),
